# Reactive Surface Water Material RT BP Report - 2026-07-06

## Scope

- Adds a BP-only Water RT driver for the Material/RT water path.
- The driver is independent from `NS_RS_Water`; existing Niagara assets are left intact.
- Demo map `/Game/ReactiveSurface/Demo/L_RS_Demo` contains `BP_RS_WaterRTDriver`.
- `RS_Water_SourceActor` is exposed and the demo instance is bound to `BP_Piper_ReactivePrototype`, avoiding the SIE spectator pawn path.
- Runtime default `RS_Water_MinSpeedWS` is `5.0` cm/s so stationary players do not keep injecting impulses; this matches the HTML drag/input-only impulse behavior.
- Runtime default `RS_Water_WaveSpeed` is `0.38`, a conservative speed increase over the previous `0.31` while staying inside the solver clamp.
- Runtime default `RS_Water_WindowSizeWS` is `1500.0` cm, so the Water RT covers 15m x 15m.
- Runtime default `RS_Water_Damping` is `0.9813`, which stretches the previous `0.945` decay time about 3x without clamping to 1.0.
- Runtime trail controls are exposed: length `360.0` cm, strength `0.65`, fade `0.82`, tap count `6.0`.

